<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
        <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
        <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
        <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>
        <PackageId>Yuzhu.Yarp.Swagger</PackageId>
        <Version>3.0.0</Version>
        <Authors>Yuzhu</Authors>
        <Description>Swagger / OpenAPI aggregation for YARP. Discovers backend Swagger endpoints from YARP runtime state and configuration through pluggable sources and address resolvers, aggregates documents with explicit 200/404/503 semantics, and refreshes on YARP config changes.</Description>
        <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/lijon2015/yarp-swagger</PackageProjectUrl>
        <PackageTags>yarp;swagger;openapi;reverse-proxy;api-gateway</PackageTags>
        <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
        <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
        <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/lijon2015/yarp-swagger</RepositoryUrl>
        <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>
v3.0.0 - Major rewrite. No backward compatibility with v2.x.
 - Replaced ISwaggerEndpointProvider with a five-interface discovery pipeline:
   ISwaggerEndpointDiscoveryService, ISwaggerEndpointSource,
   ISwaggerEndpointAddressResolver, ISwaggerMetadataAccessor, ISwaggerRefreshTrigger.
 - SwaggerEndpointDiscoveryResult now exposes structured per-cluster diagnostics so
   skipped/failed clusters can be explained in logs.
 - Removed the fake "/swagger/v1/swagger.json" UI placeholder. UI urls now reflect only
   real discovered documents; configurable EmptyBehavior controls what happens when
   discovery returns zero documents.
 - New UseSwaggerAggregationDocuments() middleware owns 200/404/503 semantics. Unknown
   documents return 404 with a known-document list; known-but-unavailable returns
   503 (configurable).
 - Refresh is event-driven: options change, periodic timer, and YARP config change tokens.
   Project-specific triggers can be added via the builder.
 - SwaggerAggregationBuilder grew AddSource, AddAddressResolver, InsertAddressResolver,
   AddRefreshTrigger, and ConfigureDocumentEndpoint hooks.
 - Telemetry tags and metric names aligned with the long-term plan
   (cluster.id, document.name, destination.address, http.status_code, failure.stage).
See CHANGELOG.md for migration notes.
        </PackageReleaseNotes>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
            <_Parameter1>Yuzhu.Yarp.Swagger.Tests</_Parameter1>
        </AssemblyAttribute>
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Duende.AccessTokenManagement" Version="4.2.0" />
        <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience" Version="10.5.0" />
        <PackageReference Include="Swashbuckle.AspNetCore.SwaggerGen" Version="10.1.7" />
        <PackageReference Include="Swashbuckle.AspNetCore.SwaggerUI" Version="10.1.7" />
        <PackageReference Include="Yarp.ReverseProxy" Version="2.3.0" />
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
